{
    "title": "Knights of Pen & Paper 2: RPG",
    "description": "\"It does give that Dungeons & Dragons feel that we love\" -Gamer.nl\r\n\r\n\"What better way to have some fun with the traditions of fantasy video games and nerd culture than through a game where you role-play as a role-player?\" -IGN\r\n\r\n\"There's something genuinely pleasant about Knights of Pen and Paper 2, especially if you're a fan or tabletop role playing. It pokes fun, but it's always warm towards its subject matter.\u201d -Pocket Gamer\r\n\r\n------------\r\n\r\nYou are hereby cordially re-invited to Paperos, the realm of Knights of Pen & Paper 2, to create and foster a party of eager new heroes!\r\n\r\nTheir mouths salivating for an adventure, your job is to level-up and gear-up the heroes powerful enough to face the Paper Knight \u2013 and save the world from his unbalanced rule-changes...\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2022 Generational leap: From 8-bit to 16-bit graphics!\r\n\u2022 Plethora of options to create characters of various playstyles!\r\n\u2022 Dozens of hours of Main Quests and Side Quests to complete!\r\n\u2022 Grind and hoard loot like it's 1995!\r\n\u2022 3 unlockable expansions!\r\n\u2022 Tinker your Game Room into an ultimate man-cave!\r\n\u2022 Daily challenges, crafting, New Game+ and tons of other cool stuff to do even after the Main Questline is complete!\r\n\r\n------------\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for an epic retro style turn-based RPG or JRPG adventure wrapped around beautiful pixel art, then look no further: get Knights of Pen and Paper 2: Rerolled NOW!",
    "descriptionHTML": "&quot;It does give that Dungeons &amp; Dragons feel that we love&quot; -Gamer.nl<br><br>&quot;What better way to have some fun with the traditions of fantasy video games and nerd culture than through a game where you role-play as a role-player?&quot; -IGN<br><br>&quot;There&#39;s something genuinely pleasant about Knights of Pen and Paper 2, especially if you&#39;re a fan or tabletop role playing. It pokes fun, but it&#39;s always warm towards its subject matter.\u201d -Pocket Gamer<br><br>------------<br><br>You are hereby cordially re-invited to Paperos, the realm of Knights of Pen &amp; Paper 2, to create and foster a party of eager new heroes!<br><br>Their mouths salivating for an adventure, your job is to level-up and gear-up the heroes powerful enough to face the Paper Knight \u2013 and save the world from his unbalanced rule-changes...<br><br><br>\u2022 Generational leap: From 8-bit to 16-bit graphics!<br>\u2022 Plethora of options to create characters of various playstyles!<br>\u2022 Dozens of hours of Main Quests and Side Quests to complete!<br>\u2022 Grind and hoard loot like it&#39;s 1995!<br>\u2022 3 unlockable expansions!<br>\u2022 Tinker your Game Room into an ultimate man-cave!<br>\u2022 Daily challenges, crafting, New Game+ and tons of other cool stuff to do even after the Main Questline is complete!<br><br>------------<br><br>If you&#39;re looking for an epic retro style turn-based RPG or JRPG adventure wrapped around beautiful pixel art, then look no further: get Knights of Pen and Paper 2: Rerolled NOW!",
